{"evidence":[{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0063","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0063","raw_content":"看着真惬意和朋友一起小酌一杯心情都变好了","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0064","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0064","raw_content":"我梅见大瓶3瓶倒[捂脸]","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0117","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0117","raw_content":"酒桌文化啥时候能消失","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0119","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0119","raw_content":"到底谁还在酒桌应酬我感觉身边的老登都开始不喝酒了","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0120","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0120","raw_content":"怎么才算是是酒桌文化我们领导和同事间聚餐都会喝点酒不过都是各人量力而行","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0124","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0124","raw_content":"梅见配火锅真的绝了解辣又好喝","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0146","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0146","raw_content":"那5000个陶坛的酒库也太壮观了","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"DY-SOC-0158","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-DY-SOC-0158","raw_content":"烟熏梅见好喝吗求真实口感","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"JD-20260809-051","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-JD-20260809-051","raw_content":"梅见这款原味青梅酒真是太适合女生小聚了！12度微醺刚刚好，不会醉却很有氛围。开瓶就是清新的青梅香气，入口酸甜柔顺，不涩不辣，加冰喝简直绝配。330ml小瓶装一人一瓶刚刚好，整箱囤货聚会随时开。冰镇后配火锅或烧烤特别解腻，比普通饮料更有仪式感。已经回购好几次了，闺蜜们都夸好喝。想找一款不踩雷的微醺甜酒，选梅见准没错！","source_platform":"京东","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0003","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0003","raw_content":"“梅见酒后劲大吗”“梅见喝了第二天头疼吗”“梅见兑什么喝”“梅见哪个口味最好喝”“梅见青梅酒喝完容易上头吗”","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0004","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0004","raw_content":"\"梅见的青梅酒很烂 虽然说便宜 但是高度高粱酒的基酒辣嗓子 高度蒸馏直接盖过去 而且苦涩 入口没有任何融合\r\n推荐昆竹牌三得利古越龙山 都碾压梅见\"“[捂脸R]反正当时买完打开一瞬间的很后悔就是了”","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0008","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0008","raw_content":"青序磨砂瓶没有了 我现在买的这个 感觉比磨砂瓶更重味道这点 其他都不错 冰梅酒是这款 昆竹的  这些都碾压梅见 真心的 那种配料表里有浓缩青梅汁的直接pass","source_platform":"B站","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0018","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0018","raw_content":"别单喝很伤胃的，这个兑汽水好一点，醒目就挺好喝！而且比例是酒少汽水多一点，也不涨肚子！但是每次喝梅见胃都要痛好几天，前几天刚喝了兑汽水胃没事，后面半瓶没兑直接喝的给我整吐了","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0019","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0019","raw_content":"单喝梅见真的很难喝","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0021","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0021","raw_content":"这款150毫升的小瓶梅见实在是太可爱啦，对于一个梅见迷来说，小瓶刚刚好，一次喝完，不怕会变味，7种味道，本人最喜欢烟熏风味的，超酸的也不错，送的山岩杯颜值也很高！","source_platform":"京东","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0032","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0032","raw_content":"单喝有点酸，兑过元气森林葡萄水和水溶C西柚，味道都不错，还有淡淡的梅子香，好喝不辣口（没有照片了，已经喝完了）","source_platform":"淘宝","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0044","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0044","raw_content":"2.青梅绿茶+梅见 比例3:1","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0045","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0045","raw_content":"3.酸梅汤+梅见 比例2:1","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0046","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0046","raw_content":"4.冰红茶+梅见 比例1:1","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0097","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0097","raw_content":"在日本呆了8天，喝了8天，三得利的梅子酒真的好好喝！\r\n+气泡水和绿茶都可以","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0099","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0099","raw_content":"俏雅CHOYA 玻璃瓶/带梅子/纸包装\r\n�大概50/360ml 100/720ml\r\n便宜是他们唯一的优点，糖浆味较重，建议还是配冰或苏打水","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"MJ-RAW-0319","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-MJ-RAW-0319","raw_content":"每杯酒都超量……一般人喝完一两杯……","source_platform":"抖音","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"TB-20260809-022","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-TB-20260809-022","raw_content":"一个不爱喝酒的人士第一次主动买了酒来尝尝，一下就给我尝到味了，虽说是青梅酒，但不像其他的喝着没啥酒味，这个是酸甜适度，也有酒的涩，综合起来很平衡，纯喝或者调一点冰红茶都挺好喝的，现在一到周末就会小酌一杯🥃","source_platform":"淘宝","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"TB-20260809-044","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-TB-20260809-044","raw_content":"小资产阶级，跟闺蜜吃饭时一人一瓶正好，酒量不好就是喝着开心，一瓶下肚微醺","source_platform":"淘宝","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"TB-20260809-049","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-TB-20260809-049","raw_content":"烟熏乌梅风味儿青梅酒非常好喝，喝青梅酒就选梅见，好喝不贵，5分好评！","source_platform":"淘宝","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0012","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0012","raw_content":"敬酒是把自己放在极致低位的行为","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0014","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0014","raw_content":"我就不敬 公司聚餐一桌同事个个都在互相敬酒 我不仅不喝酒我还谁都不敬","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0016","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0016","raw_content":"我都二十多岁了，依然讨厌过年的酒桌文化","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0019","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0019","raw_content":"看了一下梅见的成分表，第1位带水的都不要买。还有放浓缩果汁的那些通通都是勾兑的。","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0021","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0021","raw_content":"你相信我姐妹，这个比原味好喝太多","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0037","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0037","raw_content":"说白了，单喝不好喝。加什么都好喝","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0041","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0041","raw_content":"加青梅绿茶，我觉得挺好喝的","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0046","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0046","raw_content":"昆竹白金版，或者进口俏雅。但是，都太甜，必须加冰喝。和自己泡的还是差太远。","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0195","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0195","raw_content":"其实日本的梅见真的很好喝我感觉国内的梅见跟日本的梅见不是一个东西","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0196","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0196","raw_content":"这酒喝完口渴特别特别口渴","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0232","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0232","raw_content":"一个人的微醺才是最放松的","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0236","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0236","raw_content":"晚上喝了半瓶，恶心死，人还没晕先吐了","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0239","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0239","raw_content":"一个人喝酒可爽了","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0241","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0241","raw_content":"一个人才叫喝酒 几个人那叫吹牛逼大会","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"},{"comment_id":"XHS-SOC-0257","evidence_id":"formal-evidence-XHS-SOC-0257","raw_content":"加椰子水 好喝","source_platform":"小红书","source_type":"USER_COMMENT"}],"schema_version":"submission_evidence_catalog_v1"}
